   "w": 760,
   "kind": "dark",
   "title": "Systemically unwell, several organs, purpura: is it vasculitis, and which?",
   "lines": [
    "every patient: head-to-toe history and exam · blood count, creatinine, liver enzymes, sedimentation rate (ESR) and C-reactive protein (CRP), urinalysis · chest X-ray",
    "kidneys and lungs can be SILENT · rule out INFECTION before immunosuppressing"
   ]
  },
